id: genie
name: Genie
order: 4
category: body
# A Factor Trait replaces a Secondary Racial Trait - Secondary, then, unless it names a Primary one to replace.
importance: secondary
# (2)
grantsOther: monstrous
grantsOtherFrom: unique-monstrosity
description: >
  Your magical, mystical nature allows you the uncanny use of preternatural powers and the ability to survive hits that would incinerate lesser beings.
text: >
  Genie (Body): Your magical, mystical nature allows you the uncanny use of preternatural powers and the ability to survive hits that would incinerate lesser beings.
  (1)-[Passive]: You may use your Magic Modifier instead of your Force Modifier when calculating Surgency (see — Surges).
  (2)-[Passive]: You gain access to the Unique Monstrosity Monstrous Trait.
  (3)-[Passive]: Increase your Damage Reduction by 1/2 of your Insight Modifier.
  (4)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you receive no Damage from an Opponent’s Attacking Maneuver that targeted you due to any means, you may use a Surge as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver but only apply 1/4 (rounded up) of your Surgency.

---

# (2) Its header - in the Other Traits list, gained with it.
[passive]
# (1) The Magic Modifier where it is the higher.
allow surgency.magic;
# (3)
damageReduction += floor(insight.mod / 2);
# (4) No Damage from an Opponent's attack at you: the Surge offered on its card, once a Round - a quarter of your Surgency, rounded up
# (chat.mjs genieOffer).
allow genie.surge;
